    "⚠️ There is no autosave. Save Changes writes the canvas; Discard Changes throws away everything since the last save — and is itself one Undo away. Unsaved edits survive switching screens and are offered for saving when you quit." : {
      "comment" : "A warning about autosave.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
