    "⚠️ Undo does NOT cover a node's PROFILE — its model, instructions, tools or knowledge. Those are saved to the profile itself, and not only when you press Done: deleting the node, opening another node's inspector, or starting a run — which switches away from the canvas — all save them too. Cancel is the one way to throw them away. The canvas cannot take them back." : {
