    "A dedicated on-device MLX model that runs background intelligence tasks to improve your experience. Runs locally — no data leaves your machine." : {

    },
    "A deterministic text transform — no AI involved. Write a template using {{ input }}, {{ input.json.path }} for a field of JSON output, and {{ var.name }}; optionally store the result in a variable for later nodes. ⚠️ A placeholder that can't be resolved (e.g. a misspelled variable) is left in the output verbatim — check spelling; the validator does not lint Code templates. Never retries; failure routes to the error port." : {

    },
    "A draft stays in the library but is never offered to an agent, even where it is linked." : {

    },
    "A failure never cancels parallel branches and never stops the whole run. Work that succeeded elsewhere keeps its results." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of how failures are handled in a workflow.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A field you edited can't be left empty." : {

    },
    "A local MLX model classifies input into your rule labels when no pattern matches." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the AI classifier works.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A node can't connect to itself." : {
      "comment" : "User-facing message for when a user tries to create a loop.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A node with several incoming wires waits for all of them — except a branch that could never fire because a Router or Gate chose a different way. The engine works that out from the graph; there is nothing to configure." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing how a node with several incoming wires waits for all of them.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A node's input is the joined output of the upstream nodes whose wires actually fired. One upstream arrives as-is; several arrive separated by a divider line." : {
      "comment" : "A node's input is the joined output of the upstream nodes whose wires actually fired. One upstream arrives as-is; several arrive separated by a divider line.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A profile named '%@' already exists." : {

    },
    "A Profile node bound to another Workflow profile — it runs that workflow's canvas as a child. Text-only handoff: the child gets this node's input as its message; variables and artifacts do not cross in (artifacts produced inside do flow out). Nesting is limited to 3 levels and cycles are blocked at design time. ⚠️ This node's Per-Node Timeout bounds the child's ENTIRE run — size it for the whole child, not one step." : {
      "comment" : "A Profile node bound to another Workflow profile — it runs that workflow's canvas as a child. Text-only handoff: the child gets this node's input as its message; variables and artifacts do not",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
